Run 1's two boot legs failed for a defect in this script, not in the product:
an env-assignment prefix cannot be produced by parameter expansion —
${1:+PROCESSING_PIPELINE=on} is parsed as a WORD, so the assignment after it
became the command name ("DATABASE_URL=file:...: No such file or directory").
Fixed by passing the whole environment to env(1). npm ci, the migration chain
and the build from run 1 are VALID and are reused rather than repeated:
